(f\(x\) = a_0/2 + sum_{n=1}^inf [ a_n cos\(n pi x / L\) + b_n sin\(n pi x / L\) ]) '
(Euler's Formulae:) '
(- a_0 = \(1/L\) * int_{-L}^L f\(x\) dx) '
